  [38;5;246m/btw what's the project codename and my favorite color?[39m

    The capital of Australia is Canberra. It was purpose-built as a compromise after Sydney and Melbourne, the two
    largest and rival cities, couldn't agree on which should be the capital, so a new site roughly between them was
    chosen in 1908 and the city was founded in 1913.

